  "description": "CR 715.3a, 715.2b, 715.2c, 715.4, 122.1d, 502.3, 701.26a: Summon: Shiva's chapters I and II each tap a creature an opponent controls and put a stun counter on it; chapter III draws a card for each tapped creature its controller's opponents control",
